  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "The table describes the eight components of the digital adaptation kit (DAK) for antenatal care, from health interventions and recommendations to functional and non-functional requirements. For each component it gives a description, its purpose, the outputs it produces and the adaptation needed for a local context.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
